:''Not to be confused with [[Kuwagata Cat (Switch Special Cat)]] or [[Kabuto Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Kuwagata Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Nets. It was added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 616
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kuwagata Cat
|name2 = King Kuwagata Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''King Kuwagata Cat''' at Level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kuwagata Cat can be seen as a lesser version of [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]] that targets different traits. Its lackluster damage makes it mainly a meatshield, although its not-so-impressive health prevents him from being of much use in [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] stages except for very early stages in [[Into the Future]] and VERY niche stages in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] like [[Urura (Cats of the Cosmos)|Urura]] as [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] outclasses him in both stats and cost effectiveness, but, with enough grinding, its + levels can make him worthwhile for most of the game.

It has little use due to the presence of alternatives, but may prove extremely important in some 4-crowns [[Legend Stages]], even better if paired with research combos or Catellite.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

