==Trivia==
*Kuwagata Cat gets its name from ''kuwagata'', stylized antlers typically seen on [[:wikipedia:Kabuto|kabuto]] helmets. Kuwagata is also the Japanese word for stag beetle.
*For the first run of [[Summer Break Cats Paradise (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Paradise]], Kuwagata Cat was obtained from it, rather than from Summer Break Cats.

